WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 line:75%
Algeciras: five dates to understand the city.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:75%
711. Tariq founds Al-Yazirat Al-Hadra, "the Green Island".

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000 line:75%
1344. Alfonso XI takes it after a 20-month siege.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000 line:75%
1379. Muhammad V of Granada destroys it.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000 line:75%
1704. Exiles from Gibraltar refound it.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:75%
1906. International Conference and a new port.
